s22:s21:oveq1d |- ( ( ( Z e. CC /\ 1 < ( Re ` Z ) ) /\ k e. NN ) -> ( sum_ i e. ( 1 ... k ) ( ( q e. NN |-> ( ( 2 x. ( q mod 2 ) ) - 1 ) ) ` i ) x. ( ( k ^c -u Z ) - ( ( k + 1 ) ^c -u Z ) ) ) = ( ( k mod 2 ) x. ( ( k ^c -u Z ) - ( ( k + 1 ) ^c -u Z ) ) ) )
